# GCP authentication

Project: `project-1ed4b477-d344-46ba-a89`

Use Application Default Credentials. Do not export a service account JSON key.

Org policy `iam.disableServiceAccountKeyCreation` is enforced on this project.
Do not disable it. Do not run `gcloud iam service-accounts keys create`.
Do not set `GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS` to a downloaded key file.

The `cli-admin` service account
(`cli-admin@project-1ed4b477-d344-46ba-a89.iam.gserviceaccount.com`) has
Owner, but key creation is blocked and must stay blocked.

```sh
gcloud auth login --update-adc
gcloud config set project project-1ed4b477-d344-46ba-a89
gcloud projects describe project-1ed4b477-d344-46ba-a89
```

If `gcloud` is missing, install it with `brew install --cask gcloud-cli`.
SDKs pick up ADC from `~/.config/gcloud/application_default_credentials.json`.
That file is outside the workspace and must never be committed or pasted.
